      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brighton%2C_Boston",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Brighton’s Green Line B branch has 11 stops along Commonwealth Avenue, ending at Boston College on the western edge.",
