      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brighton%2C_Boston",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town library began as the Holton Library, founded after a bequest from James Holton, a prominent resident.",
